msgid "Converting"
msgstr "変換中:"

msgid "the file"
msgstr "ファイル"

msgid "Saving"
msgstr "保存中:"

msgid "Recover"
msgstr "復元"

msgid ""
"Unsaved changes from a\n"
"session that did not end\n"
"were kept. Recover them?"
msgstr ""
"終了しなかったセッションの\n"
"未保存の変更が残っています。\n"
"復元しますか?"

#, c-format
msgid ""
"%d character cannot be saved\n"
"as %s. Save as UTF-8\n"
"instead?"
msgid_plural ""
"%d characters cannot be saved\n"
"as %s. Save as UTF-8\n"
"instead?"
msgstr[0] ""
"%d 文字を %s で\n"
"保存できません。\n"
"UTF-8で保存しますか?"

msgid "Encoding"
msgstr "文字コード"

msgid "Save failed"
msgstr "保存できません"

msgid ""
"The file could not be\n"
"written completely.\n"
"The one on the card is\n"
"as it was."
msgstr ""
"ファイルを最後まで\n"
"書き込めませんでした。\n"
"カード上のファイルは\n"
"元のままです。"

#, c-format
msgid ""
"Saved, but as\n"
"%.60s:\n"
"it could not be renamed."
msgstr ""
"保存しましたが、名前は\n"
"%.60s\n"
"のままです (名前を変更できません)。"

msgid "Save"
msgstr "保存"

msgid "Export"
msgstr "書き出し"

msgid ""
"convert could not\n"
"be started."
msgstr ""
"convertを起動\n"
"できませんでした。"

msgid ""
"Could not write the\n"
"copy to convert."
msgstr ""
"変換用のコピーを\n"
"書き込めませんでした。"

#, c-format
msgid ""
"%.40s already exists.\n"
"Replace it?"
msgstr ""
"%.40s は既にあります。\n"
"置き換えますか?"

msgid "Save As"
msgstr "名前を付けて保存"

msgid "Getting ready to print"
msgstr "印刷の準備中:"

msgid "Untitled"
msgstr "無題"

#, c-format
msgid "Print %.60s"
msgstr "%.60s を印刷"

#, c-format
msgid ""
"There was no room in %s\n"
"for the text to print."
msgstr ""
"%s に印刷する文書を\n"
"置く場所がありません。"

msgid "Print"
msgstr "印刷"

#, c-format
msgid ""
"The print job could not\n"
"be made in %s."
msgstr ""
"%s に印刷ジョブを\n"
"作成できませんでした。"

msgid "print is not on the card."
msgstr "カードにprintがありません。"

msgid ""
"The print job could not\n"
"be written."
msgstr ""
"印刷ジョブを\n"
"書き込めませんでした。"

msgid "Unsaved changes"
msgstr "未保存の変更"

msgid ""
"Save changes before\n"
"continuing?"
msgstr ""
"続ける前に変更を\n"
"保存しますか?"

msgid "Open failed"
msgstr "開けません"

msgid ""
"That file could not\n"
"be read."
msgstr ""
"ファイルを\n"
"読めませんでした。"

msgid "Too large"
msgstr "大きすぎます"

msgid ""
"That file is larger than\n"
"this editor can hold on\n"
"this machine."
msgstr ""
"このマシンのエディタで\n"
"扱える大きさを\n"
"超えています。"

msgid "Opening"
msgstr "開いています:"

msgid ""
"That file is too large for\n"
"this editor once its accented\n"
"letters are converted."
msgstr ""
"アクセント付き文字を\n"
"変換すると、エディタで\n"
"扱えない大きさになります。"

msgid "Copy"
msgstr "コピー"

msgid ""
"Copied, but there is no\n"
"memory to keep all of it:\n"
"a paste gives the first\n"
"4 KB."
msgstr ""
"コピーしましたが、全体を\n"
"保持するメモリがありません。\n"
"貼り付けは最初の4 KBです。"

msgid ""
"Too large to cut here:\n"
"there is no memory to\n"
"keep it for the paste.\n"
"Cut less than 4 KB."
msgstr ""
"大きすぎて切り取れません:\n"
"貼り付けまで保持する\n"
"メモリがありません。\n"
"4 KB未満にしてください。"

msgid ""
"Too large to cut:\n"
"it could not be undone.\n"
"Cut a smaller part."
msgstr ""
"大きすぎて切り取れません:\n"
"元に戻せなくなります。\n"
"小さく分けてください。"

msgid "Cut"
msgstr "切り取り"

msgid "Full"
msgstr "いっぱいです"

msgid ""
"Only part of the clipboard\n"
"would fit."
msgstr ""
"クリップボードの一部しか\n"
"入りません。"

msgid "The document is full."
msgstr "文書がいっぱいです。"

msgid "blank"
msgstr ""

msgid "end"
msgstr ""

msgid "new line"
msgstr ""

msgid "Empty document"
msgstr ""

msgid "End of document"
msgstr ""

msgid "Nothing selected"
msgstr ""

msgid "Finding"
msgstr "検索中:"

#, c-format
msgid ""
"\"%.60s\"\n"
"was not found."
msgstr ""
"\"%.60s\"\n"
"は見つかりません。"

msgid "Find"
msgstr "検索"

msgid "Find:"
msgstr "検索:"

msgid "Counting"
msgstr "集計中:"

msgid "Replacing"
msgstr "置換中:"

msgid "Replace"
msgstr "置換"

msgid ""
"The document would not hold\n"
"the replacements."
msgstr ""
"置換すると文書に\n"
"収まりません。"

msgid "Replace with:"
msgstr "置換後:"

#, c-format
msgid ""
"%d match for \"%.40s\".\n"
"Replace all of them?\n"
"(No: one at a time.)"
msgid_plural ""
"%d matches for \"%.40s\".\n"
"Replace all of them?\n"
"(No: one at a time.)"
msgstr[0] ""
"%d 件 (\"%.40s\")。\n"
"すべて置換しますか?\n"
"(いいえ: 1つずつ)"

msgid ""
"That many changes cannot\n"
"be undone. Replace all\n"
"anyway?"
msgstr ""
"この数の変更は\n"
"元に戻せません。\n"
"すべて置換しますか?"

#, c-format
msgid "Replaced %d."
msgstr "%d 件置換しました。"

msgid "Replace this one?"
msgstr "これを置換しますか?"

msgid "the document"
msgstr "文書"

#, c-format
msgid "%d word"
msgid_plural "%d words"
msgstr[0] "%d 語"

#, c-format
msgid "%d character"
msgid_plural "%d characters"
msgstr[0] "%d 文字"

#, c-format
msgid "Line %d of %d."
msgstr "%d / %d 行。"

msgid "Go to line:"
msgstr "行へ移動:"

msgid "Go to line"
msgstr "行へ移動"

#, c-format
msgid ""
"A plain text editor for notes, lists and Markdown.\n"
"\n"
"Ctrl+N/O/S\tNew, open, save\n"
"Ctrl+Shift+S\tSave as\n"
"Ctrl+Q\tClose\n"
"Ctrl+C/X/V\tCopy, cut, paste\n"
"Ctrl+A\tSelect all\n"
"Ctrl+Z/Y\tUndo, redo\n"
"Ctrl+F, F3\tFind, find again\n"
"Ctrl+H\tReplace\n"
"Ctrl+L\tGo to line; counts words\n"
"Ctrl+P\tPrint, or print to a PDF\n"
"\n"
"Shift with the arrows, or a drag, selects. A .docx, .odt or .rtf opens converted, as Markdown in %s (the RAM disk): Save puts it in %s."
msgstr ""
"メモ、リスト、Markdown用のシンプルなテキストエディタです。\n"
"\n"
"Ctrl+N/O/S\t新規、開く、保存\n"
"Ctrl+Shift+S\t名前を付けて保存\n"
"Ctrl+Q\t閉じる\n"
"Ctrl+C/X/V\tコピー、切り取り、貼り付け\n"
"Ctrl+A\tすべて選択\n"
"Ctrl+Z/Y\t元に戻す、やり直し\n"
"Ctrl+F, F3\t検索、次を検索\n"
"Ctrl+H\t置換\n"
"Ctrl+L\t行へ移動。語数も数える\n"
"Ctrl+P\t印刷、またはPDFに印刷\n"
"\n"
"Shiftと矢印、またはドラッグで選択します。.docx, .odt, .rtf はMarkdownに変換して %s (RAMディスク) に開きます。保存すると %s に置かれます。"

msgid "Text help"
msgstr "textのヘルプ"
